() Tj T*
( Retrieval Evaluation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The six-document sample is only a smoke test. To avoid overstating quality, a separate) Tj T*
(evaluation harness runs labeled known-answer queries and reports Hit@1, Hit@3, and Mean) Tj T*
(Reciprocal Rank. A broader local run inspected 80 live Qanoon posts and produced 67 full) Tj T*
(documents after skipping official-gazette index pages. The set contained 24 royal decrees) Tj T*
(and 43 ministerial decisions, with 247 chunks, 171 topic links, and 271 extracted cross-) Tj T*
(reference mentions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(On six positive known-answer queries over this 67-document set, the staged results were:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| Stage | Precision@3 | Recall@3 | Hit@1 | Hit@3 | MRR | Reranker executed |) Tj T*
(| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |) Tj T*
(| Dense only | 0.222 | 0.667 | 0.667 | 0.667 | 0.699 | 0/6 |) Tj T*
(| Hybrid + graph context | 0.333 | 1.000 | 1.000 | 1.000 | 1.000 | 0/6 |) Tj T*
(| Hybrid + graph context + rerank | 0.333 | 1.000 | 1.000 | 1.000 | 1.000 | 6/6 |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The hybrid stage improves Recall@3 by 0.333 and MRR by 0.301 over dense-only retrieval. The) Tj T*
(cross-encoder ran for all positive queries and preserved the already-perfect hybrid ranking,) Tj T*
(so this small/easy set shows no additional rerank lift rather than an invented one. The) Tj T*
(cases cover health specialties, sports entities, urban planning, postal services, judicial) Tj T*
(enforcement for Ministry of Commerce officers, and the A'Sharqiya University branch) Tj T*
(decision. These hand labels are a sanity check, not a scientific benchmark.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The negative-control query, "Which Omani decree regulates mining colonies on Mars?", still) Tj T*
(returns nearest neighbors because the current search client always ranks available) Tj T*
(candidates. A production system needs a calibrated no-answer threshold using held-out) Tj T*
(negative queries and score distributions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Another important limitation is legal currentness. The graph stores REPEALS and AMENDS) Tj T*
(edges, but the retrieval client does not yet demote repealed laws or compute a consolidated) Tj T*
(current-law status. A production legal search system should mark repealed/amended) Tj T*
(instruments, prefer current law by default, and still expose historical law when the query) Tj T*
(asks for it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Scaling Bottlenecks) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The main bottlenecks are crawl time under polite rate limits, Arabic PDF extraction quality,) Tj T*
(LLM topic extraction cost, embedding throughput, and Neo4j write volume. At larger scale,) Tj T*
(ingestion should split into independent queues: discovery, fetch, parse, graph upsert, topic) Tj T*
(extraction, chunking, and embedding. The current loader batches documents, chunks, topics,) Tj T*
(legal references, and community assignments; at larger scale those batches should be queue-) Tj T*
(driven with retryable write jobs. Embeddings should run on GPU workers or a managed) Tj T*
(embedding service.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The system deliberately avoids CAPTCHA bypass. If throttling or CAPTCHA appears, the crawler) Tj T*
(checkpoints progress, records the failing URL, and pauses for later resume.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Verification) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The repository includes offline tests for exact number parsing, English-link extraction,) Tj T*
(gazette skipping, PDF issuer parsing, Markdown cleanup, chunking, crawl-state resume) Tj T*
(records, fallback topic detection, and legal edge classification. These tests are useful but) Tj T*
(intentionally narrow; they do not prove Arabic PDF quality, cross-encoder quality, embedding) Tj T*
(quality, or end-to-end Neo4j correctness under all failure modes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Live checks performed during development covered the WordPress REST probe, Gemini smoke) Tj T*
ET
endstream
